   455	
   456	Accept a number exactly when RFC 8785's canonical serialization preserves its value. Reject otherwise. The three
   457	conditions (not negative zero, finite after round-half-even, exact decimal value of `ES(d)` equals the literal) and
   458	the accepted and rejected examples are in ENC §1.2. [A9:438-443; ENC §1.2:118-148; ENC D-1:752-755] Proof:
   459	`formal/p8/PROOF.md` Lemma 3. Vectors: `formal/p8/vectors/`.
