    49	
    50	Two values are **equal** when they are equal as mathematical structures:
    51	- numbers are equal as doubles;
    52	- strings are equal as scalar sequences;
    53	- arrays are equal as sequences;
    54	- objects are equal as finite maps from names to values. Member order is not part of an object.
