   245	
   246	A swapped presentation fails `RECEIPT_SLOT`. So does the same frame presented twice (XR-01, XR-02). A splice that
   247	changes `C` in one slot fails `RECEIPT_COMMON_MISMATCH` (XR-03). ∎
