    95	|---|---|---|
    96	| 1 | Unsigned profile label (read first, for dispatch) | [ENC §8:742-743] |
    97	| 2 | The receipt tuple `(F_kms, S_kms, F_gpg, S_gpg)`, or `A_sig`, which encodes it | [ENC §5.3:493-497] |
    98	| 3 | The manifest frame `F_manifest` and each key's possession signature over it | [ENC §4:362-369; A9:311-312] |
    99	| 4 | The two public keys, checked against the manifest fingerprints | [ENC §5.3:509] |
   100	| 5 | The DNSSEC snapshot (envelope per ENC §6) and its own OTS proof | [ENC §6:536-542; DD:94] |
   101	| 6 | The git key-assertion evidence: raw signed commit object, the tree objects on the path, the blob, and the OTS proof stamped on the commit id | [ENC §7.2:706-710; A9:282-284] |
