   105	| 10 | The conformance vector bytes (content-addressed) | [A9:152-153; ENC §3.2:281] |
   106	| 11 | The plain-language purpose preamble, bound by hash in the signed bytes | [A9:153; ENC §3.2:281] |
   107	| 12 | The dependency manifest (section 9) | [A9:153-154] |
