   140	The stage names follow the spec's. The spec registers no order between stages, only that the verdict does not
   141	depend on evaluation order. [SPEC:1237-1248; SPEC R-5.16:1250] There are ten stages after dispatch. The
   142	table presents ENC/SPEC material; it is not a newly fixed execution order (section 0.1, item 6).
   143	
