   167	
   168	- Order of decision: any required check failed gives `INVALID`; else any required check unperformable gives
   169	  `UNVERIFIABLE`; else `VALID_STRICT`. There is no waiver set, so the degraded branch never applies. [SPEC
   170	  R-5.25:1368; A9:155]
