   377	  `confirmed_at ≤ declared + δ`. All three are evaluated together. [SPEC R-4.41:985; SPEC R-5.19:1352; SPEC
   378	  V33-V36:1342-1346; A9:99]
   379	- A real proof carries several attestations hours apart and nothing in the proof names T (M3). [FT:20; DD:98]
