    62	  `Schema_attest` is E§3.2 together with E§3.3, and `Schema_manifest` is E§4.
    63	- **Frames.** `Frm(t) = { frame(t, p) : p ∈ Pay(t) }` for `t ∈ {attest, manifest}`, where
    64	  `frame(t, p) = [|t|] ‖ t ‖ 00 01 ‖ u32(|p|) ‖ p`.
    65	- **Signature slots.** For an algorithm id `a` and a slot `i ∈ {0 (kms), 1 (gpg)}`, `Sig(a, i)` is the set of
    66	  byte strings accepted by the E§5.2 rule for `(a, i)`. It is always a set of **nonempty** strings of length at
    67	  most `cap(a, i)`.
    68	  - Rule O: exactly one legacy-header v4 signature packet, with every inner length consumed exactly.
    69	  - Rule R: the strings of the parameter set's exact signature length.
    70	  - Opaque: every string of 1 to 65536 bytes.
